                    "kind": "spice",
                    "template": "X{ref} {pin:inp} {pin:inn} {pin:out} {pin:vcc} {pin:vee} lvd_comparator_oc params: vhys={vhys} tpd={tpd} ron={ron} isink={isink} iq={iq}",
                    "subcircuit": ".subckt lvd_comparator_oc inp inn out vcc vee params: vhys=0 tpd=300e-9 ron=50 isink=16e-3 iq=0.4e-3\n* behavioural open-collector comparator: output sinks to vee (up to isink, ron when saturated) while inp < inn\nBx x 0 V=tanh((V(inp,inn)+({vhys/2})*V(y))/({max(vhys/20,1e-4)}))\nRd x y 1k\nCd y 0 {tpd/693}\nBo out vee I=({isink})*tanh(V(out,vee)/({isink*ron}))*(1-V(y))/2+1e-9*V(out,vee)\nIq vcc vee {iq}\n.ends lvd_comparator_oc"
                }
