                    "subcircuit": ".subckt lvd_adjreg in adj out params: vref=1.25 vdrop=2 ilim=1.5 iadj=50e-6\n* behavioural adjustable regulator (LM317 style): V(out) - V(adj) = vref, limited to V(in) - vdrop and >= 0,\n* soft current limit at ilim, sinks at most about 10 mA; iadj flows out of the adj pin;\n* the output current is drawn from in (returned internally through ground)\nBt t 0 V=((V(adj)+({vref})-((({vref})+V(adj)-V(in)+({vdrop}))+sqrt((({vref})+V(adj)-V(in)+({vdrop}))^2+1e-4))/2)+sqrt((V(adj)+({vref})-((({vref})+V(adj)-V(in)+({vdrop}))+sqrt((({vref})+V(adj)-V(in)+({vdrop}))^2+1e-4))/2)^2+1e-4))/2\nBv x 0 V=V(t)-100*(I(Vs)-({ilim})+sqrt((I(Vs)-({ilim}))^2+1e-6))/2+100*(-I(Vs)-0.01+sqrt((I(Vs)+0.01)^2+1e-6))/2\nVs x y 0\nRo y out 10m\nBin in 0 I=I(Vs)\nIa in adj {iadj}\n.ends lvd_adjreg"
