                    "subcircuit": ".subckt lvd_tl431 k a r params: vref=2.495 gm=5 imin=0.4e-3\n* behavioural shunt reference: cathode current rises with gm above V(r,a) = vref, plus a bias current imin;\n* conduction requires V(k,a) above about 1 V\nBk k a I=(({gm})*((V(r,a)-({vref}))+sqrt((V(r,a)-({vref}))^2+1e-8))/2+({imin}))*(1+tanh((V(k,a)-1)/0.2))/2\n.ends lvd_tl431"
