                    "subcircuit": ".subckt lvd_schmitt a y params: vdd=5 vtp=3 vtn=2 rout=50 tpd=10e-9\n* behavioural Schmitt-trigger inverter: rising threshold vtp, falling threshold vtn\nRa a 0 1e9\nBl l 0 V=0.5*(1+tanh((V(a)-({(vtp+vtn)/2})+({(vtp-vtn)/2})*(2*V(d)-1))/({vdd/200})))\nRd l d 1k\nCd d 0 {tpd/693}\nBo 0 y I=(({vdd})*(1-V(d))-V(y))/({rout})\n.ends lvd_schmitt"
